    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say it gets better but it doesn't feel like that. it feels like the person i was... that person died when he did. i'm just going through the motions now. it's just tiring to keep pretending like there's something left to hold onto. it feels like like a burden than a life at this point.",
